{
 "name": "micro_wick",
 "description": "Liquidation-wick resting limits: at each 6h run, limit buy at P*(1-m*sigma_1h*sqrt(6)) (optional mirror sell), fill only if a later 1h bar trades through by >= 10 bp, TP at a partial retrace, SL one more m*sigma, time exit at the next run; maker 0.02% entry, taker on stop; longs skipped when BTC 24h < -10%.",
 "mechanism": "Providing liquidity into forced liquidation cascades earns a premium.",
 "universe": "16 long-lived majors (lab MAJORS)",
 "timeframe": "1h bars, orders refreshed at 6h runs",
 "n_trials": 12,
 "stage": "screen only (Step 1) - own pessimistic simulator (sim.run_events has no limit entries)",
